The lyrics are identical in both versions with only minor differences in the music (Willie has a longer instrumental bridge).  This is based on Toby’s version.

TIP:  Lingering double strums at the end of most lines.  

TIP:  Sounds fine with with (A) and (E) instead of (A7) and (E7) too.   
    
TIP:  Toby plays the intro in drop-d tuning.  To get around this without re-tuning play the (D) as a C-shape on the 3rd fret and pick the strings indicated.  (Notes may or may not transpose.)  

 
